{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_title", "source_sha256": "497d6a84e40552aac8b244bbdad42355a9876e08426802a0f36416fb1e61c5cc", "ja": "先輩とお泊り in 萩原邸", "zh": "和前辈留宿 in 萩原宅邸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3ffab833fcdeb14e76cb1054248af6c13422d40ad6c61a30de44e36b124999df", "ja": "レッスンで遅くなり、雪歩の家に泊まる\nことになった百合子。いい機会だからと\n雪歩と真からアドバイスをもらうと、\n弱気を退けやる気をみなぎらせる。\n「風の戦士たちが力をくれると信じて！」", "zh": "百合子因上课练习结束得晚，决定住在雪步家里。\n她想着正好借此机会，从雪步和真那里得到一些建议，\n驱散了心中的软弱，重新充满干劲。\n“相信风之战士们会赐予我力量！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "d37c3678dcfc54c71b57bd8b436d515b74ecde94784992536106e82aebec66ee", "ja": "私の悩みを、先輩たちに聞いてもらうなんて、\nありがたいやら恐れ多いやら……。", "zh": "能让前辈们听我诉说烦恼，真是既感激又惶恐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bffcedad944500f4037c6ae40469fdc737cc7808481ec7bb98501a60870bf3ea", "ja": "ううん、気にしないで。レッスンが遅くなって、\nせっかくのお泊りの機会なんだから。", "zh": "不用在意啦。难得因为训练到很晚\n才有了合宿的机会呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "97c098f4feb09921e41fd376526829bb63afaafe7819f92e9b5e4a55f75837df", "ja": "ボク達もみんなのこと、もっと知りたいからね。\nそれで……百合子はダンスが苦手なんだっけ？", "zh": "我们也想更多地了解大家嘛。\n所以……百合子不擅长跳舞，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "338162e18c425e3c40b3d6fe715635c7da7d5758407362fbb602d956f30cf4c0", "ja": "は、はい。スタミナもそうなんですけど、\n自分の体の操縦がうまくいかないと言いますか……。", "zh": "是、是的。耐力也是一个问题，但该怎么说呢……我不太擅长控制自己的身体……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4c47d9dcc5b73f310b6315a637f52e5ccee899f01a768b84654dc6cd96afc2d9", "ja": "わかるなぁ。私もね、ダンスはいっぱい練習して、\n今でも自信なんか全然ないんだけど……。", "zh": "我懂的。我以前也是练了好多舞蹈，\n可直到现在也完全没什么自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cf7ce44a4606e5199f35c5a7d6a078be9204f73f3e9fdeb925eb136edef37caa", "ja": "でもね、やめようって思ったことはないんだ。", "zh": "不过，我从来没有想过要放弃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bcbe5f3d4a9d5b8f481d11f02482e8788246c0ea1a8d7ed7478ef0e97c7825bf", "ja": "すぐ近くに、何かをすごく頑張ってる仲間がいるとね。\nあきらめが悪くなっちゃうみたい。", "zh": "身边有拼命努力着的伙伴时，\n好像就会变得不那么容易放弃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "3c15f908089f11480549e9c1b801a47f5ec00d96adf07f67897958f6c0b66c2d", "ja": "雪歩さん……。", "zh": "雪步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "0fc7d4429f339ac3f198869d08dab19bb67052095379a435fe0786502b5f2c2b", "ja": "出来る自分を想像してみるのもいいんじゃないかな。\nこう、風を切って誰より速く動く自分とか！", "zh": "不妨想象一下自己成功时的样子。\n比如，想象自己划破风，以比任何人都快的速度前进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "71da914e0588d33a4b85895f744dde2a3fda1040e04b69df321700d31ad7974c", "ja": "風を切って、誰よりも迅く……！\nそっか、風の戦士たちが、力をくれると信じて……！", "zh": "划破长风，比任何人都快……！原来如此，我要相信风之战士们会赐予我力量……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "38720195406e07b021396a2af293126bea1eee205eed2fb179cc106057465f49", "ja": "？　……うん、よくわからないけど、いいね！\nとにかく思い切りが大事だから、自信をもって！", "zh": "？……嗯，虽然不太明白，但听起来不错！\n总之，放手去做很重要，所以要有自信！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "615ebb84ef1c854c90e44bf9532f4bcb5d1000a43fb4024d20868129b7c4c0c5", "ja": "他にも何かあったら、遠慮しないで言ってね。\n私たち、先輩っていうか……、一緒に歩く仲間だから。", "zh": "如果还有什么事，也别客气，尽管告诉我哦。\n我们与其说是前辈……不如说是一起并肩前行的伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area04_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "1af3bcea99db085a29a9a7ef2bc263df4edbc2d4864355c2c27b41cb5ee66865", "ja": "は、はい……ありがとうございます！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好、好的……谢谢您！\n请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
